# Emrakul, the Aeons Torn: "When Emrakul is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into
# their library." Entomb puts it into Bot1 graveyard from the library, and the ability, which goes on the stack once Entomb
# has resolved and is in the graveyard too, shuffles both back: the graveyard is empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Swamp x5
Emrakul, the Aeons Torn
Swamp x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Emrakul, the Aeons Torn)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
